              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.22+2SA.5.23+2SA.5.24+2SA.5.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5.22-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And the Philistines yet again made a raid in the valley. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when David again inquired of God, God said to him, “You shall not go up after them; go around and come upon them opposite the balsam trees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when you hear the sound of marching in the tops of the balsam trees, then go out to battle; for God has gone out before you to smite the army of the Philistines.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And David did as God commanded him, and they smote the Philistine army from Gibeon to Gezer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the fame of David went out into all lands, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " brought the fear of him upon all nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
